+ is invé’g] without the alternative of eva’gl. invent makes -tor. inventory. Pronounce i’nveniori.
===
+ is ĭnvē'gl without the alternative of ĕvā'gl.

**invent** makes *-tor*.

**inventory.** Pronounce ĭ'nventorĭ.
